      "id": "claim_ddec95d76274469b98a989407f76fe49",
      "statement": "Tab targeting is per-call and stateless: every tab-operating MCP tool accepts an optional string tabId, and when tabId is omitted the extension falls back to the active foreground tab via tabs.query({ active: true, currentWindow: true }); there is no select_tab session-level default.",
