      "statement": "The list_tabs tool lists all open tabs in a connected browser via tabs.query({}) and filters with isRegularPageUrl so only regular HTTP/HTTPS tabs are returned; each TabInfo carries tabId, windowId, title, url, active, and supported. Tab list is fetched on demand, not streamed.",
